{"id":"0c4f99f2719ded5b","group":"93","path":"93/93-df-modular.md","title":"Modular Lattice","display":"df-modular — Modular Lattice","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-df-modular","aliases":["93-df-modular"],"display":"df-modular — Modular Lattice","depends_on":["[[93-df-lattice]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-df-modular"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-df-modular</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-modular — Modular Lattice"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3b5f38bd115ed203\" href=\"?note=3b5f38bd115ed203\" title=\"93-df-lattice\">93-df-lattice</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf L\">\\(\\mathbf L\\)</span> is a lattice candidate and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_{\\mathbf L}\">\\(\\leq_{\\mathbf L}\\)</span> is the induced order of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3b5f38bd115ed203\" href=\"?note=3b5f38bd115ed203\" title=\"93-df-lattice\">93-df-lattice</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Lat}\">\\(\\mathrm{Lat}\\)</span> is the lattice class of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3b5f38bd115ed203\" href=\"?note=3b5f38bd115ed203\" title=\"93-df-lattice\">93-df-lattice</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ModLat}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{ModLat}_{93}\\)</span> (modular-lattice predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}modular}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ModLat}_{93}(\\mathbf L)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathbf L\\in\\mathrm{Lat}\\land\n\\forall a,b,c\\in|\\mathbf L|\\;\\Bigl(\na\\leq_{\\mathbf L}c\\to\na\\vee^{\\mathbf L}(b\\wedge^{\\mathbf L}c)=\n(a\\vee^{\\mathbf L}b)\\wedge^{\\mathbf L}c\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}modular}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ModLat}_{93}(\\mathbf L)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathbf L\\in\\mathrm{Lat}\\land\n\\forall a,b,c\\in|\\mathbf L|\\;\\Bigl(\na\\leq_{\\mathbf L}c\\to\na\\vee^{\\mathbf L}(b\\wedge^{\\mathbf L}c)=\n(a\\vee^{\\mathbf L}b)\\wedge^{\\mathbf L}c\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Equality is essential: the omitted direction is exactly the modular condition, whereas the original one-sided inequality holds in every lattice. Carrier and operations now come from <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf L\">\\(\\mathbf L\\)</span> itself.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-lattice","status":"resolved","id":"3b5f38bd115ed203","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-lattice]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-lattice","status":"resolved","id":"3b5f38bd115ed203","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathbf L$ is a lattice candidate and $\\leq_{\\mathbf L}$ is the induced order of [[93-df-lattice]].","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-lattice","status":"resolved","id":"3b5f38bd115ed203","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Lat}$ is the lattice class of [[93-df-lattice]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbf L","display":false},{"tex":"\\leq_{\\mathbf L}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Lat}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ModLat}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}modular}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ModLat}_{93}(\\mathbf L)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathbf L\\in\\mathrm{Lat}\\land\n\\forall a,b,c\\in|\\mathbf L|\\;\\Bigl(\na\\leq_{\\mathbf L}c\\to\na\\vee^{\\mathbf L}(b\\wedge^{\\mathbf L}c)=\n(a\\vee^{\\mathbf L}b)\\wedge^{\\mathbf L}c\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathbf L","display":false}],"bytes":975,"backlinks":[{"id":"ad379574ef6f3a71","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ModLat}_{93}$ is the modular-lattice predicate of [[93-df-modular]]."},{"id":"1d735fa5476ec4af","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ModLat}_{93}(\\mathbf A)$, where $\\mathrm{ModLat}_{93}$ is the predicate of [[93-df-modular]]."},{"id":"7640f770f9f763e9","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["3b5f38bd115ed203"]}